    "notes": [
      "Treat sampler IDs as Draw Things version-dependent numeric enum values; verify against the installed CLI before production use.",
      "Four steps and CFG 1.0 are conservative starting points for a distilled Klein model, not universal optima.",
      "Do not assume more steps or higher CFG improves results.",
      "Record seed, exact prompt, model checksum/version, LoRA hashes, dimensions and CLI version for reproducibility."
    ]
  },
